      "text": "What does it cost?",
      "ts": "2026-01-01T00:00:00+00:00",
      "message_id": "id-7"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Cost-wise, Duke meets full demonstrated need for every admitted student, and around half the class receives some form of aid. The sticker price looks intimidating, but the net price for aided families is dramatically lower, and there are no loans in the aid packages for families under the income thresholds.",
